      "bottomRightY": 313,
      "content": "$$\\psi(\\mathfrak{r}) = u_0(\\mathfrak{r}) = \\int c(\\mathfrak{s})e^{ik(\\mathfrak{r}\\mathfrak{s})} d\\omega, \\quad d\\mathfrak{s} = c^*(\\mathfrak{s}), \\tag{11}$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
